pnpm clean

# Fresh install
rm -rf node_modules
pnpm install

# Rebuild
pnpm build
```

### Q: TypeScript errors?
**A:** Update types:
```bash
# Regenerate types
pnpm astro sync

# Check configuration
pnpm tsc --noEmit
```

## Getting Help

